9     procs:
          RUSERSPROC_NUM
               No arguments, returns number of users as an _u_n_s_i_g_n_e_d _l_o_n_g.
          RUSERSPROC_NAMES
               No arguments, returns _u_t_m_p_a_r_r or _u_t_m_p_i_d_l_e_a_r_r, depending on version number.
          RUSERSPROC_ALLNAMES
               No arguments, returns _u_t_m_p_a_r_r or _u_t_m_p_i_d_l_e_a_r_r, depending on version number.
               Returns listing even for _u_t_m_p entries satisfying _n_o_n_u_s_e_r() in _u_t_m_p._h.
     versions:
          RUSERSVERS_ORIG
          RUSERSVERS_IDLE

